fcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=VqLkfWG_CVAQ7kNvwHr5tMV&_nc_oc=AdqpRI5DhaExGhqP4unkAJEBy5dVc_Qw1l0l8YFag0eo2wAQHP8wznerUCozbCkPZHM&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-bom2-4.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=iAJPsaO7NH2UQdXBm6Zymw&_nc_ss=7f289&oh=00_AQLoDxaFwsiVzKWwWMMAt8fhsfPxJ2IeMsCvVJnnPHlg0w&oe=6AA58F48)\n\n[housieyonsite](/housieyonsite/)\n\n•\n\nFollow\n\n---\n\n[![housieyonsite's profile picture](https://scontent-bom2-4.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/645980392_18055785770445356_5777331388139416446_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=VqLkfWG_CVAQ7kNvwHr5tMV&_nc_oc=AdqpRI5DhaExGhqP4unkAJEBy5dVc_Qw1l0l8YFag0eo2wAQHP8wznerUCozbCkPZHM&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-bom2-4.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=iAJPsaO7NH2UQdXBm6Zymw&_nc_ss=7f289&oh=00_AQLoDxaFwsiVzKWwWMMAt8fhsfPxJ2IeMsCvVJnnPHlg0w&oe=6AA58F48)](/housieyonsite/)\n\n[housieyonsite](/housieyonsite/) Edited•\n\nShreeji Atlantis Malad West | Luxury 2BHK & 3BHK Flats In Mumbai  \n  \n🏙✨ Shreeji Atlantis – Premium 2 & 3 BHK Living in Malad West  \n  \nBy Shreeji Construction  \n  \n📍 Prime Location – Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \nMalad West ke sought-after Orlem location mein situated Shreeji Atlantis aapko deta hai high-rise luxury living with modern comforts, excellent connectivity aur 35+ lifestyle amenities ka premium combination. 🌿🏡  \n  \nExcellent Connectivity:  \n▫️ Valnai–Meeth Chowky Metro Station – 550 m  \n▫️ Infiniti Mall – 1.8 km  \n▫️ Malad Railway Station – 2.0 km  \n  \n🌟 USP – “Malad West, Orlem mein ek aisa project jahan aapko milta hai high-rise tower with 35+ amenities.”  \nShreeji Atlantis un homebuyers ke liye perfect hai jo Mumbai ke prime suburban location mein ek premium high-rise lifestyle chahte hain. Yahan aapko milta hai spacious residences, great connectivity aur lifestyle amenities ka perfect urban blend. 🏡✨  \n  \n🏗 Project Overview  \n🔹 Spread across 2 Acres of Land Parcel  \n🔹 Single Premium Tower  \n🔹 Structure: G + 6P + 45 Floors  \n🔹 2BHK & 3BHK Premium Residences  \n  \n🌿 35+ Luxurious Lifestyle Amenities Include:  \n🏊 Swimming Pool  \n🧒 Kids Play Area  \n🏋️ Gymnasium  \n✨ And Many More  \n  \n🏡 Configurations & Carpet Area:  \n▫️ 2BHK – 734 to 770 sq.ft.  \n▫️ 3BHK – 980 sq.ft.  \n  \n🗓 Possession Timeline:  \n▫️ RERA Possession – December 2028  \n  \n🌐 Explore Now: https://housiey.com/projects/shreeji-atlantis   \n  \n👉 For brochures, pricing offers and site visits please do visit www.housiey.com and book your dream house today.  \n.  \n.  \n[#shreejiatlantis](/explore/tags/shreejiatlantis/) [#shreejiconstruction](/explore/tags/shreejiconstruction/) [#maladwesthomes](/explore/tags/maladwesthomes/) [#orlemproperty](/explore/tags/orlemproperty/) [#flatsinmaladwest](/explore/tags/flatsinmaladwest/) [#2bhkinmumbai](/explore/tags/2bhkinmumbai/) [#3bhkinmumbai](/explore/tags/3bhkinmumbai/) [#mumbairealestate](/explore/tags/mumbairealestate/) [#luxuryhomesmumbai](/explore/tags/luxuryhomesmumbai/) [#highriseliving](/explore/tags/highriseliving/) [#housiey](/explore/tags/housiey/)\n\n## No comments yet.\n\nStart the conversation.\n\n8\n\n[Log in](/accounts/login/?next=%2Freel%2FDWeEjG-E49Q&source=post_comment_input) to like or comment.\n\n---\n\nMore posts from [housieyonsite](/housieyonsite/)\n\n[![Video by Housiey OnSite on September 08, 2026. May be an image of ‎text that says '‎주 HOUSIEY HOME HOME HOMEBUYINGSIMPLIFED BUYING UYINGSIMPI SIMPLIFIED Metro Saraswati Square MetroGroup Metro Group LTLTENDING SRLRISEE ي PLMENCE መለባሰስ D[W] Cal:+91 930 DtWICaR+919930000058 930.00 058 930000058 ၂စး‎'‎.](https://scontent-bom5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/799525588_18089940068445356_6865549322682595798_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=6Bjban3kF4kQ7kNvwGiH7oI&_nc_oc=Adp1c8XY4Xg6vU7Gpf4NsoRbIFbSuhhtAMjKMMTz-bMbmPR1lull6q6Ydouap7NAvEg&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bo