","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/shreeji-atlantis-malad-west-cmmkb5u5q00r0sa1fycfjsfn1","title":"Shreeji Atlantis, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457331-3baa4d3543bd9290.webp)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/shreeji-atlantis/builderlogos-shreeji-group-logo-png-bed749.png)\n\nBig Like Your Heart.\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457330-a7a40f40e537a8f9.webp)\n\n## 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\n₹ 2.20 – 2.94 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457322-7a82530b50967d92.webp)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/shreeji-atlantis/builderlogos-shreeji-group-logo-png-bed749.png)\n\nBig Like Your Heart.\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457321-081083b9e67c97bb.webp)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457330-a7a40f40e537a8f9.webp)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\n₹ 2.20 – 2.94 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 25 Aug, 2026\n\nShreeji Atlantis\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Shreeji Construction](/builder/shreeji-group-1 \"Open Shreeji Construction page\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 2.20 – 2.94 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 1.91 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 31 Dec 2027 Onwards\n\n#### Phase 1\n\nIs Under Construction\n\n* Tower Main TowerCompletion In 30 Dec 2027\n* Tower Tower ACompleted in 30 Dec 2023\n\nShreeji Atlantis is a premium residential high-rise located in Malad West, Mumbai, developed by Shreeji Group of Companies. The project features a 45-storey tower offering thoughtfully designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and some larger configurations with typical sizes ranging from approx. 734–980 sq. ft. and prices around ₹1.6 Cr–₹2.5 Cr+ depending on unit type and size—making it suited to families seeking modern urban living. Spread across several acres within the larger Shreeji SuperNest community, Atlantis provides 30+ lifestyle amenities including an infinity pool, gymnasium, banquet hall, multipurpose court, kids’ play area, landscaped gardens, and multilevel parking with EV charging provisions to support a contemporary lifestyle. Strategically located, the project is well connected to Malad Railway Station, Western Express Highway, Dahanukar Wadi Metro, Infinity Mall, schools, hospitals, and business hubs, ensuring convenience and strong neighbourhood appeal for both residents and investors.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n11374.9 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n2\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n2 & 3 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n52\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n29 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalad West\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400064\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nBhagwan Gautam Buddha Road\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nBhagwan Gautam Buddha Rd, Malad, Orlem, Malad, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064, India\n\n## ExploreConfigurations\n\n#### Browse all available units by phase, tower, and configuration\n\n##### 2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n2 Variants Available734 - 770 sq ft\n\n₹ 2.20 – 2.31 Crore\n\n##### 3 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1 Variant Available980 sq ft\n\nStarting From\n\n₹ 2.94 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.20 Cr\n\n734 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/shreeji-atlantis-wing-b/shreeji-atlantis-mumbai-2bhk-floor-plan-jpg-dd0da3.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2027\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.20 Cr\n\n734sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.20 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/shreeji-atlantis-wing-b/shreeji-atlantis-mumbai-2bhk-floor-plan-jpg-dd0da3.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2027\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.31 Cr\n\n770 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/shreeji-atlantis-wing-b/shreeji-atlantis-mumbai-2bhk-floor-plan-jpg-41d401.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2027\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.31 Cr\n\n770sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.31 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/shreeji-atlantis-wing-b/shreeji-atlantis-mumbai-2bhk-floor-plan-jpg-41d401.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2027\n\n## AboutProject\n\nShreeji Atlantis is a premium residential high rise located in Malad West, Mumbai, developed by Shreeji Group of Companies. The project features a 45 storey tower offering thoughtfully designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and some larger configurations with typical sizes ranging from approx. 734–980 sq. ft. and prices around ₹1.6 Cr–₹2.5 Cr+ depending on unit type and size—making it suited to families seeking modern urban living. Spread across several acres within the larger Shreeji SuperNest community, Atlantis provides 30+ lifestyle amenities including an infinity pool, gymnasium, banquet hall, multipurpose court, kids’ play area, landscaped gardens, and multilevel parking with EV charging provisions to support a contemporary lifestyle. Strategically located, the project is well connected to Malad Railway Station, Western Express Highway, Dahanukar Wadi Metro, Infinity Mall, schools, hospitals, and business hubs, ensuring convenience and strong neighbourhood appeal for both residents and investors\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/children-play-area-56fac0.png)\n\nChildren's Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/meditation-hall-e68efc.png)\n\nMeditation Zone\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/club-house.svg)\n\nClub House\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/power-backup.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/meditation-room.svg)\n\nMeditation Room\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/children-play-area.svg)\n\nChildren Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/visitor-parking-and-basement-podium-parking-3b1ce3.png)\n\nVisitor Parking\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/banquet-hall.svg)\n\nBanquet Hall\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/guest-room-194532.png)\n\nGuest Room\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/basketball-court.svg)\n\nBasketball Court\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n1of1\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalad West is a lively and self-sufficient Mumbai suburb known for its busy commercial and shopping scene, including major malls and corporate parks. This dynamic area offers a diverse real estate market, from affordable homes to luxury residences. With plenty of dining and entertainment options, and great connectivity through Link Road and SV Road, it provides a lifestyle of ultimate convenience. An investment here guarantees a complete city experience where work and leisure are perfectly balanced in a thriving, well-connected community.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1773985457329-b626814a1e25f093.webp)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800047335\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Shreeji Group](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-group-logo-jpg-2-f9fab2.jpg)](/builder/shreeji-group-1 \"Shreeji Group\")\n\nShreeji Group![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –93 years\n\nShreeji Group is a dedicated developer focused on creating residential spaces that are \"extraordinary in thought, design, and lifestyle.\" Their projects, such as Shreeji Today Royal, are designed to be an echo of the homeowner’s personality, status, and achievements. They emphasize meticulous craftsmanship and glorious elevations to raise the bar for elite living in Navi Mumbai. The developer prioritizes the emotional experience of the resident, ensuring that the entrance and interiors are filled with positivity and a welcoming feel. By integrating nature seamlessly with modern amenities, Shreeji Group creates environments that promote peace, harmony, and happiness. Their commitment to quality is evident in their selection of prime locations like Kharghar, where they build landmarks that reflect aspirations.\n\n3ProjectsCompleted\n\n5OngoingProjects\n\n1In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Shreeji Atlantis in West Pune\n\nShreeji Atlantis is developed by Shreeji Construction, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nShreeji Atlantis is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Shreeji Atlantis at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Shreeji Atlantis is expected by Dec 2027, as per the RERA filing.\n\nShreeji Atlantis falls under the COMPLEX housing segment, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Shreeji Atlantis are P51800004400, P51800047335. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Shreeji Atlantis is 11374.9 SQM, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces.\n\nKey nearby highlights from Shreeji Atlantis include ORCHIDS The International School, Zenith Hospital, Malad and more within easy reach for daily needs.\n\nShreeji Atlantis offers 3 BHK, 2 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nYes, Shreeji Atlantis offers dedicated parking for residents, ensuring convenience and security for personal vehicles.\n\nShreeji Atlantis consists of 2 towers with 52 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nYes, Shreeji Atlantis is being developed by the developer, a RERA-registered entity ensuring legal and timely construction.\n\nThe carpet area of apartments in Shreeji Atlantis ranges from 734 sq.ft sq.ft for 2 BHK to 980 sq.ft sq.ft for 3 BHK, depending on the configuration.\n\nShreeji Atlantis is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe pricing for units in Shreeji Atlantis starts from ₹2.20 Cr - ₹2.94 Cr.\n\nShreeji Atlantis comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nFlats in Shreeji Atlantis include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.\n\nShreeji Atlantis offers a wide range of amenities including Children's Play Area, Meditation Zone, Swimming Pool, Club House, Power Backup, Meditation Room, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Children Play Area, Visitor Parking, Banquet Hall, Guest Room, Basketball Court, Infinity Pool, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Guest Rooms For Visitors, Cab Pickup Point, Basketball Turf, Access Control, Security Cabin, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Swimming Pool With Deck, Car Parking, Gym, Meditation Area, Lift, Infinity Swimming Pool, Conference Halls.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹2.20 Cr per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nShreeji Atlantis is located at\n\nShreeji Atlantis offers Children's Play Area, Meditation Zone, Swimming Pool, Club House, Power Backup, Meditation Room, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Children Play Area, Visitor Parking, Banquet Hall, Guest Room, Basketball Court, Infinity Pool, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Guest Rooms For Visitors, Cab Pickup Point, Basketball Turf, Access Control, Security Cabin, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Swimming Pool With Deck, Car Parking, Gym, Meditation Area, Lift, Infinity Swimming Pool, Conference Halls for a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nThe carpet area for available units ranges from 734 sq.ft to 980 sq.ft\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inShreeji Atlantis?\n\nShreeji Atlantis, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.aurumproptech.in/pulse/rera/maharashtra/mumbai-suburban/shreeji-atlantis-wing-a-P51800004400","title":"Shreeji Atlantis Wing A - RERA No. P51800004400 - Aurum PropTech","raw_content":"New Launch - India Real Estate Report 2026.\n\n[![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.png&w=1200&q=75)](/pulse)\n\nKnowledge Hub\n\n![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai\n\nServices\n\nFOR BUYERS & RENTERS\n\n[Explore verified properties across cities](/pulse/properties)[Home Loan\n\nLow-interest loans with expert support](/pulse/aurum-kuberx)[Packers & Movers\n\nReliable rel