rovals have been received from the relevant authorities.\n\n![Project completed](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Frera-assets%2Fcorrect.png&w=96&q=75)\n\nCompleted\n\n31st Dec 2023\n\nThe project has been fully built and is ready for possession or use.\n\nAcknowledgement No.\n\nREA51800011818\n\nProject Type\n\nOthers\n\nDistrict\n\nMumbai Suburban\n\nTaluka\n\nBorivali\n\nState\n\nMAHARASHTRA\n\n## Project Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Shreeji Atlantis Wing A |\n| RERA Registration No. | P51800004400 |\n| Acknowledgement No. | REA51800011818 |\n| Registration Date | 2017-08-09 |\n| Proposed Completion Date | 2023-12-31 |\n| Project Status | Completed |\n| Project Type | Others |\n| Land Area | 4385.0 |\n\n## Project Address Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Address | 1pt, 2pt, 264, 265, 266, 216A/1A, 216A/1A/1, 216A/1/4 to 10 |\n| State | MAHARASHTRA |\n| District | Mumbai Suburban |\n| Taluka | Borivali |\n| Village | Borivali |\n| Pincode | 400064 |\n| Boundary East | By D P Road |\n| Boundary West | By CTS Nos 265-217-218-219-220-223 |\n| Boundary North | By CTS No 214 - D P Road |\n| Boundary South | By CTS No 216A-Pt-DP Road |\n\n## Land Area Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Final Plot Bearing No. | 1pt, 2pt, 264, 265, 266, 216A/1A, 216A/1A/1, 216A/1/4 to 10 |\n| Total Land Area | 4385.0 |\n| Land Area for Project | 4385.0 |\n| Permissible FSI | 15404.0 |\n| Sanctioned Build-up Area | 6659.09 |\n| Aggregate Area | 107.42 |\n\n## Promoter Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Promoter Type | Partnership |\n| Promoter Name | Shreeji Construction |\n| Communication Address | GAUTAM BUDDHA MARG 1st FLOOR, CTS NO 216 SHREEJI ATLANTIS MALAD WEST ORLEM Mumbai Suburban MAHARASHTRA 400064 |\n\n## Member Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Member 1 | Nimesh Uttambhai Desai |\n| Designation | Partner |\n| Mobile | 98\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* |\n| Email | shr\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*@gmail.com |\n| Member 2 | Bhushan Kha