reeji Atlantis Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\nLast updated: Sep 4, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Malad_Elevation_--1688476580134-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Elevation--1688476585902-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Elevation_--1688476586726-img-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241416-567564338-1280w.webp)![Project image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241461-894581899-1280w.webp)![Project image 6](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241498-877107093-1280w.webp)![Project image 7](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241545-573633622-1280w.webp)\n\n# Shreeji Atlantis Malad West\n\n[By Shreeji Construction](/builder/shreeji-construction)|\n\nOrlem, [Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\n₹2.33 Cr - 3.07 Cr All inc.\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Malad_Elevation_--1688476580134-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Elevation--1688476585902-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Elevation_--1688476586726-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241416-567564338-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Malad West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1744202241461-894581899-1280w.webp)\n\n2+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Shreeji Atlantis\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Shreeji Atlantis\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.5 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+6P+39\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n734-980 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800004400\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nMid Stage (1-2 yrs)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2027\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2027\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nYes\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Shreeji Atlantis\n\nShreeji Malad West Project Overview  \nShreeji Atlantis Project will be constructed on 1.5 acres of land parcel, 2 towers with G+6P+39 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nShreeji Atlantis location  \nProject is located Near Malad - Marve Rd, Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai with -  \nValnai-Meeth Chowky Metro - 550m  \nInfiniti Mall - 1.8km  \nMalad Railway Station - 2.0km  \n  \nShreeji Atlantis Malad Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, Anti skid tiles, Exhaust fan, Earthquake resistance, Fire fighting, CCTV, Biometric security system & many more  \n  \nShreeji Construction Malad West External Amenities  \nProject has 20+ luxurious amenities with likes of -  \nInfinity Pool  \nKids play area  \nEV charging station  \nGymnasium  \nJogging track & Many More  \n  \nShreeji Construction Atlantis Malad West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nShreeji Atlantis Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2027  \nTarget Possession - December 2027  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nAtlantis project has 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n2BHK - (734 to 770) sqft  \n3BHK - 980 sqft  \n  \nShreeji Atlantis floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 5 flats 4 lifts & 2 staircases on each floor  \n  \nAtlantis Malad West project sample flat is ready to view at the site.  \n  \nShreeji Atlantis Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Shreeji Atlantis Malad West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Shreeji Construction Malad West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Location\n\nNr Malad - Marve Rd, Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n* Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro - 550m\n* Infiniti Mall - 1.8km\n* Malad Railway Station - 2.0km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Videos\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located in a prime area, offering excellent connectivity to Malad Railway Station, Malad Metro Station, and Infiniti Mall.\n\n2.With expansive carpet areas—particularly the 770 sq.ft. 2BHK units—this project stands out in a market dominated by smaller layouts. Perfect for those who prefer roomy, comfortable homes.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.With no balconies in the apartments, buyers who value outdoor seating or open spaces may find this project less suitable.\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Digital Lock](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652425081443-img.webp)\n\nDigital Lock\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n![Exhaust Fan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652439548355-img.webp)\n\nExhaust Fan\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/cctv-camera_External_1770712182845-897978997.webp)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n![Fire Fighting](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/fire-fighting_External_1770712237914-35127023.webp)\n\nFire Fighting\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Kids Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446316261-img.webp)\n\nKids Pool\n\n![Infinity Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/infinity-pool_External_1770724878499-455179032.webp)\n\nInfinity Pool\n\n![Banquet Hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/banquet-hall_External_1770879343210-675134790.webp)\n\nBanquet Hall\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Pool deck](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446683644-img.webp)\n\nPool deck\n\n![Indoor games](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/indoor-games_External_1770730286045-726989382.webp)\n\nIndoor games\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Car charging Station](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652445444689-img.webp)\n\nCar charging Station\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/shreeji-atlantis_1775546937029-18525740-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Floor Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shreeji_Atlantis_Typical_Floor_Plan--1688622403091-img-1280w.webp)\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 734 sqft | 2.33 Cr All In | 35.00 Lacs | 1 |\n| 770 sqft | 2.44 Cr All In | 37.00 Lacs | 1 |\n\nCarpet:734 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 734 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/Shreeji_Atlantis_2_BHK_734_sqft_Unit_Plan--1688622954536-img.webp)\n\n2.33 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n35.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n1Parking\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\nCarpet:770 sqft\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nYes\n\n| Court Name | City | Case Type | Petition | Case Number | Year | Case Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Bombay City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 3040 OF 2011 | 2011 |\n| Bombay City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 3041 OF 2011 | 2011 |\n| Bombay City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 3042 OF 2011 | 2011 |\n| Bombay City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 3043 OF 2011 | 2011 |\n| Bombay City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 1753 OF 2016 | 2016 |\n\n## Documents For Shreeji Atlantis\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nShreeji Atlantis Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nShreeji Atlantis Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nShreeji Atlantis Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/8908)\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800004400](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1744201597033-64189844.webp)\n\nP51800004400](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/8908)\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800047335](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1744201597050-771879738.webp)\n\nP51800047335](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/40852)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Shreeji Construction\n\nShreeji Construction\n\n![Shreeji Construction](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/logo-orange--1688475992247-img.webp)\n\n3 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburbanPune\n\n11 yearsExperience\n\n4Total Projects\n\nShreeji Group has been one of the most dynamic and fastest-growing real estate companies of Mumbai’s Western Suburbs, sculpting spaces that redefine the essence of modern luxury. We take pride in upholding the reputation for our thoughtfully conceived projects, solid construction, latest engineering techniques and the ability to take on projects of scale and complexity, providing value and growth for the customers.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 2BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2027** as per RERA. Construction is currently **55%** complete as of August 20, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2027**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800004400**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/8908>\n\nYes, litigation details are disclosed as per RERA:  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n  \nReview all documents carefully before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800004400**.\n\nThis project offers **19+** amenities. Key external amenities include Car charging Station, Gymnasium, Indoor games, Pool deck, and Seating Area.  \n Internal specifications include Fire Fighting and CCTV Camera. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Shreeji Atlantis, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **734 sq. ft.**  \n• **770 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Shreeji Atlantis, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **980 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Shreeji Atlantis starts from **₹2.33 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **734 sq. ft.** – ₹2.33 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **770 sq. ft.** – ₹2.44 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Shreeji Atlantis starts from **₹3.07 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **980 sq. ft.** – ₹3.07 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **1.5 acres** with **2** towers with **G+6P+39** floors. Each floor has **5** flats per floor, **4** lifts, **2** staircases. It is available in **2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **734** to **980 sq. ft.**\n\nShreeji Atlantis provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Shreeji Atlantis project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Nr Malad - Marve Rd, Orlem, Malad West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Valnai-Meeth Chowky Metro - 550m**   \n**• Infiniti Mall - 1.8km**   \n**• Malad Railway Station - 2.0km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹35.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Shreeji Construction**, a trusted real estate brand with over **11 years** of experience and more than **4 completed projects** across **Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban and Pune**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Shreeji Bliss** in Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Shreeji Solitaire** in Kandivali West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Shreeji Sai Divine** in Kandivali West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Shreeji Nakshatra** in Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Shreeji Eternity** in Malad West, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Malad West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Shreeji Construction** - with 11 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK at ₹2.33 Cr to ₹3.07 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Sheth Irene](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/sheth-irene_1773211317528-220150597-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Sheth Irene](/projects/sheth-irene)\n\n₹ 1.45 Cr - 4.50 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)\n\n442- 1355sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nOct 2028\n\n1BHK\n\n442sqft\n\n₹1.45 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n680sqft\n\n₹2.25 Cr\n\n(1+1)BHK Jodi\n\n884sqft\n\n₹2.90 Cr\n\n(1+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1119sqft\n\n₹3.75 Cr\n\n(2+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1355sqft\n\n₹4.50 Cr\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)Developer\n\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Elevation--1687947769005-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](/projects/gurukrupa-marina-enclave)\n\n₹ 1.59 Cr - 2.96 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Gurukrupa Group](/builder/gurukrupa-group)\n\n442- 838sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nReady\n\n1BHK\n\n442sqft\n\n₹1.59 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n618sqft\n\n₹1.94 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n645sqft\n\n₹1.96 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n683sqft\n\n₹2.08 Cr\n\n3BHK\n\n818sqft\n\n₹2.96 Cr\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n634sqft\n\n-\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n636sqft\n\n-\n\