 B\n\n# Shreeji Atlantis Wing B\n\nFlats by **[Shreeji Group](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-shreeji-group)** at Shreeji Atlantis, Bhagwan Gautam Buddha Road, Malad, Orlem, Lourdes Colony, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800047335\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR2.15 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR2.15 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK\n\nPossession DateJun 2026\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area770\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 27.92 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Shreeji Atlantis Wing B Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/4171/original/typical.jpg?1689938599)\n\n[![Shreeji Atlantis Wing B Apartment 2 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/three_d_plans/40101/original/2bhk.jpg?1689938598)\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800047335\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shreeji-atlantis/6872/project","title":"Shreeji Atlantis, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.32 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![The Shreeji Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-shreeji-group-1454-9742.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Shreeji Atlantis Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-atlantis-project-large-image3.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Shreeji Atlantis Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-atlantis-amenities-features5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Atlantis Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-atlantis-tower-view6.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Shreeji Atlantis Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shreeji-atlantis-flagship2.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.32 Cr - 3.20 Cr**\n\n₹29,200 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Shreeji Atlantis, Malad West by The Shreeji Group\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Shreeji Atlantis.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  734 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.32 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  770 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.40 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  978 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.19 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  980 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.20 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nShreeji Atlantis's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Shreeji Atlantis | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 29100 | 30800 |\n| Mar 2026 | 32550 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 33550 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 35200 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nShreeji Atlantis avg. price is ₹ 29.1 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 32,000 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,800 |\n| Current Project **Shreeji Atlantis** | ₹ 29,100 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,100 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Shreeji Atlantis ranges from ₹ 65.7 K to ₹ 79.2 K with options available for 2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Shreeji Atlantis | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 65.7 K | - |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 79.2 K | - |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Shreeji Atlantis.\n\nA total of 9 residential transactions has been registered so far for Shreeji Atlantis, amounting to ₹ 16 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Shreeji Atlantis ranges from ₹ 62 K to ₹ 80 K with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 81% completion.\n\nA total of 171 out of 188 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 88% of 3 BHK(37 out of 42 units), 92% of 2 BHK(132 out of 144 units), 100% of SHOP(2 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 81% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 80% completion.\n\nA total of 116 out of 203 launched units have been booked as of February 2025, including 88% of SHOP(7 out of 8 units), 42% of 3 BHK(14 out of 33 units), 61% of 2 BHK(95 out of 156 units).\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n9 Sales Transactions Registered in Shreeji Atlantis From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 26.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 9 | ₹ 16 Cr | ₹ 26,250 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Shreeji Atlantis Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 770 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Atlantis, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-atlantis-apartment-2-bhk-771sqft-20254606104642.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.40 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 734 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Atlantis, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-atlantis-apartment-2-bhk-733sqft-20254606104650.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.32 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 978 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Atlantis, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-atlantis-apartment-3-bhk-978sqft-20254606104623.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.19 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 980 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shreeji Atlantis, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shreeji-atlantis-apartment-3-bhk-980sqft-20254606104634.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.20 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Shreeji Atlantis\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Shreeji Atlantis to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Shreeji Atlantis Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/shreeji-atlanti